  message: "Same shape seen 2026-09-23 on an OBJECT owner: 'from ctypes import cdll; cdll.LoadLibrary(p)' -> python:ctypes:0-0:cdll.LoadLibrary, not classified, while 'ctypes.cdll.LoadLibrary(p)' classifies fs_read (INV-dihun). The from-import form puts the owner in the name slot instead of the module slot."  # a1c1
